s://blueprint.cdn.prismic.io/blueprint/aOx7kJ5xUNkB13fE_Typescript.svg","aOx7kJ5xUNkB13fE",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":34},"Typescript",{"item_logo":221,"item_title":182},{"dimensions":222,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":179,"id":180,"edit":223},{"width":178,"height":178},{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":34},{"item_logo":225,"item_title":230},{"dimensions":226,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":227,"id":228,"edit":229},{"width":162,"height":162},"https://blueprint.cdn.prismic.io/blueprint/aOx7i55xUNkB13e__JavaScript.svg","aOx7i55xUNkB13e_",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":34},"Javascript","FAQ","Quick answers to common questions.",[234,240,246,252,258,264,270,276],{"item_title":235,"item_content":236},"Why choose HireConnect for recruitment and job search?",[237],{"type":19,"text":238,"spans":239,"direction":22},"HireConnect brings together job seekers, candidates, recruiters, and companies on a modern MERN platform built for verified skills, transparent profiles, and high-retention hiring.",[],{"item_title":241,"item_content":242},"How does HireConnect source and verify top talent?",[243],{"type":19,"text":244,"spans":245,"direction":22},"Candidates build verified profiles and undergo our SkillScreen™ evaluation. Recruiters review verified skills, portfolios, and interview performance to ensure ideal job matching.",[],{"item_title":247,"item_content":248},"Can recruiters and companies customize their hiring criteria?",[249],{"type":19,"text":250,"spans":251,"direction":22},"Yes. Recruiters and hiring teams can customize role criteria, technical assessments, and interview stages to match specific company needs.",[],{"item_title":253,"item_content":254},"What placement guarantees does HireConnect offer?",[255],{"type":19,"text":256,"spans":257,"direction":22},"Yes. We offer a placement satisfaction guarantee with dedicated recruiter support, ensuring seamless onboarding and long-term hiring success.",[],{"item_title":259,"item_content":260},"How fast can companies hire through HireConnect?",[261],{"type":19,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":22},"For verified talent in our network, matches occur within 48 hours. Most companies complete hiring workflows within 1 to 2 weeks.",[],{"item_title":265,"item_content":266},"How much time will I save by recruiting through HireConnect?",[267],{"type":19,"text":268,"spans":269,"direction":22},"Traditional tech hiring takes 15+ hours weekly per open role. With HireConnect, recruiters spend under 3 hours by accessing pre-screened, skill-verified applicants directly.",[],{"item_title":271,"item_content":272},"How does HireConnect differ from traditional recruitment agencies?",[273],{"type":19,"text":274,"spans":275,"direction":22},"We are not a bloated agency with steep markups. HireConnect is a modern MERN platform empowering direct interaction between candidates, recruiters, and companies with verified profiles.",[],{"item_title":277,"item_content":278},"What if a role requires a specialized technical stack?",[279],{"type":19,"text":280,"spans":281,"direction":22},"Our platform covers full MERN stack, cloud architecture, and modern web & mobile engineering, connecting you with verified specialists for any requirement.",[],"Our Approach to Recruitment | HireConnect","Built for the modern tech ecosystem. Every candidate profile highlights verified skills, connecting job seekers, recruiters, and companies with trust.","A Smarter Way to Recruit Top Tech Talent","Every engineer faces CTO-led vetting. Only 1–2 make it through — so you only meet the right people, never wasting time in interviews again.",{"dimensions":287,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":290,"id":291,"edit":292},{"width":288,"height":289},1200,630,"https://images.prismic.io/blueprint/aZTtt1WLo0XkEm2C_Blueprint-Opengraph-Approach.png?auto=format,compress","aZTtt1WLo0XkEm2C",{"x":32,"y":32,"zoom":33,"background":34},{"id":294,"uid":5,"url":5,"type":295,"href":296,"tags":297,"first_publication_date":298,"last_publication_date":299